;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊙</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">tanh</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>DeepAR</strong>（Amazon, 2019）将 LSTM 与自回归概率输出结合——每步输出一个参数化分布（如负二项分布或 Student-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>），通过蒙特卡洛采样生成预测区间。DeepAR 的关键创新是<strong>全局模型</strong>：一个网络同时学习所有序列的共享模式，通过嵌入（embedding）区分不同序列。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>局部模型（ARIMA/ETS）</th>\n<th>全局模型（DeepAR）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>训练数据</td>\n<td>单条序列</td>\n<td>全部序列联合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数共享</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>跨序列共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷启动</td>\n<td>需长历史</td>\n<td>可借助相似序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可扩展性</td>\n<td>线性（序列独立）</td>\n<td>一个模型覆盖全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非线性能力</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"第二代-专用神经网络架构\">第二代：专用神经网络架构</h2><h3 id=\"n-beats-neural-basis-expansion\">N-BEATS（Neural Basis Expansion）</h3><p>Oreshkin 等人（2019）提出的纯前馈架构，M4 竞赛冠军：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>由多个 <strong>stack</strong> 组成，每个 stack 含多个 <strong>block</strong></li>\n<li>每个 block 通过全连接层产生两个输出：<strong>回看信号</strong>（backcast，拟合输入）和<strong>前看信号</strong>（forecast，预测未来）</li>\n<li>Block 之间用残差连接：后续 block 拟合前序 block 未捕捉的部分</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>可解释版本</strong>：限制基函数为多项式（趋势 stack）和傅里叶（季节 stack），实现分解式预测。</p>\n<h3 id=\"n-hits-neural-hierarchical-interpolation\">N-HiTS（Neural Hierarchical Interpolation）</h3><p>N-BEATS 的改进版（Challu 等人, 2022）——引入多尺度采样和插值：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不同 block 以不同下采样率处理输入（捕捉不同时间尺度）</li>\n<li>输出通过插值恢复到目标分辨率</li>\n<li>大幅减少长视野预测的参数量（比 N-BEATS 参数少 3x，速度快 10x）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"temporal-fusion-transformer-tft\">Temporal Fusion Transformer（TFT）</h3><p>Google（2019）提出的多视野预测架构，设计重点是<strong>可解释性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>变量选择网络（VSN）：自动筛选重要的输入特征</li>\n<li>门控残差网络（GRN）：控制信息流</li>\n<li>多头注意力：捕捉长程依赖</li>\n<li>分位数输出：直接预测多个分位数</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[静态协变量] --&gt; B[变量选择网络]&#10;    C[历史时序特征] --&gt; B&#10;    D[已知未来特征] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; E[LSTM 编码器]&#10;    E --&gt; F[门控残差网络]&#10;    F --&gt; G[多头自注意力]&#10;    G --&gt; H[分位数输出层]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;预测: q10, q50, q90&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[静态协变量] --&gt; B[变量选择网络]\n    C[历史时序特征] --&gt; B\n    D[已知未来特征] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; E[LSTM 编码器]\n    E --&gt; F[门控残差网络]\n    F --&gt; G[多头自注意力]\n    G --&gt; H[分位数输出层]\n    H --&gt; I[\"预测: q10, q50, q90\"]</pre><h3 id=\"patchtst\">PatchTST</h3><p>Nie 等人（2023）将 NLP 中的 patch 思想引入时间序列：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>将输入序列切分为固定长度的 patch（类似 ViT 的图像块）</li>\n<li>每个 patch 作为一个 token 输入标准 Transformer</li>\n<li><strong>Channel Independence</strong>：各变量独立处理（避免过拟合跨通道噪声）</li>\n<li>支持自监督预训练（masked patch prediction）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"itransformer\">iTransformer</h3><p>Liu 等人（2024）提出的&quot;倒置&quot; Transformer——<strong>对变量维度做注意力，对时间维度做前馈</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个变量的完整时间序列作为一个 token</li>\n<li>注意力学习变量间的关系（替代传统的时间注意力）</li>\n<li>在多元长程预测中显著优于 PatchTST</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"第三代-时间序列基础模型\">第三代：时间序列基础模型</h2><p>2024–2026 年间，预训练范式从 NLP 迁移到时间序列领域：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>发布方</th>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>预训练数据</th>\n<th>关键特性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TimeGPT</td>\n<td>Nixtla</td>\n<td>Transformer encoder</td>\n<td>&gt;100B 数据点</td>\n<td>商用 API，零样本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chronos</td>\n<td>Amazon</td>\n<td>T5 (序列量化)</td>\n<td>公开 + 合成数据</td>\n<td>开源，将时序映射为 token</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chronos-2</td>\n<td>Amazon</td>\n<td>改进 T5</td>\n<td>更大规模</td>\n<td>多变量 + 协变量，2026.7 达 10 亿下载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TimesFM-2.5</td>\n<td>Google</td>\n<td>Decoder-only</td>\n<td>多源真实+合成</td>\n<td>Patch 输入，多分辨率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Moirai-2.0</td>\n<td>Salesforce</td>\n<td>Universal Transformer</td>\n<td>多域</td>\n<td>Any-variate，灵活 context</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>零样本预测的工作方式</strong>：模型在海量异构时间序列上预训练，学习&quot;时序结构的通用先验&quot;。推理时直接输入新序列的历史窗口，无需微调即可产出预测。</p>\n<p>2026 年 6 月的基准研究（Noguer i Alonso 等）在金融收益率预测上评估了这些模型：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>预训练基础模型在 10 个任务级排名中占 8 个首位</li>\n<li>Moirai-2.0 和 TimesFM-2.5 获得最佳平均排名</li>\n<li>但相对于随机游走基准的改善幅度小且稀疏（Diebold-Mariano 检验仅部分显著）</li>\n<li>结论：基础模型是有用的先验（降低模型开发成本），但非万能的 alpha 生成器</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from nixtla import NixtlaClient&#10;&#10;client = NixtlaClient(api_key=&#39;...&#39;)&#10;forecast = client.forecast(&#10;    df=df,&#10;    h=30,&#10;    level=[80, 95],&#10;    time_col=&#39;ds&#39;,&#10;    target_col=&#39;y&#39;&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nixtla </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NixtlaClient</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NixtlaClient(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">api_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'...'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">forecast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.forecast(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    df</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    h</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    time_col</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ds'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    target_col</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'y'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"架构选择决策框架\">架构选择决策框架</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐架构</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>冷启动 / 数据极少</td>\n<td>TimeGPT / Chronos-2（零样本）</td>\n<td>无需训练数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大量同质序列（&gt;10k）</td>\n<td>N-HiTS / DeepAR</td>\n<td>全局模型共享模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多变量 + 外生变量</td>\n<td>TFT / iTransformer</td>\n<td>变量交互建模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长视野（&gt;30步）</td>\n<td>PatchTST / N-HiTS</td>\n<td>Patch 压缩 + 多尺度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要可解释性</td>\n<td>TFT / N-BEATS interpretable</td>\n<td>注意力权重 / 基函数分解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低延迟推理</td>\n<td>Chronos-Bolt / StatsForecast</td>\n<td>小模型 / 编译实现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"训练实践要点\">训练实践要点</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>归一化</strong>：全局模型中每条序列独立做 z-score 或 min-max，预测后逆变换</li>\n<li><strong>上下文长度</strong>：通常设为 2–5 倍预测步长；PatchTST 推荐 512 步</li>\n<li><strong>学习率调度</strong>：OneCycleLR 或余弦退火；N-BEATS 对 LR 敏感</li>\n<li><strong>早停</strong>：基于验证集损失，patience 5–10 epochs</li>\n<li><strong>概率输出</strong>：分位数损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_\\tau(y - \\hat{y}) = \\max(\\tau(y-\\hat{y}), (\\tau-1)(y-\\hat{y}))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span> 直接优化</li>\n</ol>\n<p>关于状态空间框架如何从理论上统一这些模型（将深度学习编码器视为状态提取器），见 <a href=\"state-space-kalman\">状态空间模型与卡尔曼滤波</a>；关于如何公平比较这些模型的预测性能，见 <a href=\"../practice/forecast-evaluation-metrics\">预测评估与误差度量</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>深度学习预测模型的三代演进体现了从&quot;更好的单一模型&quot;到&quot;通用预训练先验&quot;的范式转变。N-BEATS/N-HiTS 证明了纯前馈网络足以竞争，PatchTST/iTransformer 用 Transformer 架构捕捉长程依赖，而 Chronos-2/TimesFM-2.5/Moirai-2.0 等基础模型则开启了零样本预测的新纪元。选择架构时需权衡四个维度：数据量（少→零样本，多→全局训练）、延迟（低→编译模型/小 Bolt 变体）、可解释性（高→TFT/N-BEATS）、多变量交互（强→iTransformer/TFT）。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"深度学习预测模型","id":"深度学习预测模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"第一代：RNN 与 LSTM","id":"第一代-rnn-与-lstm"},{"level":2,"text":"第二代：专用神经网络架构","id":"第二代-专用神经网络架构"},{"level":3,"text":"N-BEATS（Neural Basis Expansion）","id":"n-beats-neural-basis-expansion"},{"level":3,"text":"N-HiTS（Neural Hierarchical Interpolation）","id":"n-hits-neural-hierarchical-interpolation"},{"level":3,"text":"Temporal Fusion Transformer（TFT）","id":"temporal-fusion-transformer-tft"},{"level":3,"text":"PatchTST","id":"patchtst"},{"level":3,"text":"iTransformer","id":"itransformer"},{"level":2,"text":"第三代：时间序列基础模型","id":"第三代-时间序列基础模型"},{"level":2,"text":"架构选择决策框架","id":"架构选择决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"训练实践要点","id":"训练实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Prophet 与自动化预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/modern-methods/prophet-automated-forecasting"},"next":{"title":"状态空间模型与卡尔曼滤波","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/modern-methods/state-space-kalman"}}